A||N||16||Archie||NIFE Web Site coverage of Fierorama||||14||
Z||000000||Archie||09-11-2001||01:09 AM||||A few days after every Fiero Show that I go to, I always go back to the web site of the club that put on the show. It is my firm belief that if a club wants to increase interest in it's next show, it needs to have big coverage of it's past shows. Kinda like showing people what they missed and and encouraging them not to miss it next year.<P>I've been to several shows where the sponsoring group promoted the event, on their web site, extensively prior to the event but had nothing AFTER the event.<P>I just checked out the NIFE web site <A HREF="http://home.xnet.com/~nife/" TARGET=_blank>http://home.xnet.com/~nife/</A>  They have pretty good coverage including pictures of EVERY ONE of the 119 cars that were in attendance.<P>It appears that the web master still has more Event pictures to put up, but right now he has a bunch up there. <P>Keep an eye on that site for the next few days and see what you missed at this years' FieroRama.<P>You know, even with rain, 119 cars at this show is pretty darn good.<P>Archie||||reg||14
Z||000001||MikeSchaefer||09-11-2001||01:23 AM||||I agree, very good work!!  I was able to finally become a member of NIFE at Fierorama and am very impressed with the way they take care of their members.  Keep up the great work guys,<BR>Mike Schaefer <A HREF="http://surf.to/fiero" TARGET=_blank>http://surf.to/fiero</A><BR>Attendee 51<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fero.nl/uploads/attendee.jpg"> <p>[This message has been edited by MikeSchaefer (edited 09-11-2001).]||||reg||14
Z||000002||Monkeyman||09-11-2001||05:24 AM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Archie:<BR><B>They have pretty good coverage including pictures of EVERY ONE of the 119 cars that were in attendance.</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>I haven't checked out the site yet, but I know that there are a few attendees that showed up early enough to miss out of the pics.  Oreif, me, and at least one of Hazes' cars were there far too early.  <P>It was an event to remember, at least for me.  I wished it hadn't rained, but I would have been there in snow!  Great event.<P><P>------------------<BR>'Consciousness:  That annoying time between naps.'<P>MM||||reg||1
